{"timestamp": 1783617539.518753, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I reported Bob\u2019s body in medbay. My route was lower_engine -> upper_engine -> oxygen -> back through upper_engine -> medbay. I saw Eve in upper_engine around tick 9, then later Alice entered upper_engine from medbay at tick 14. Right after that I went into medbay and found Bob dead there.\n\nI didn\u2019t see Diana\u2019s body myself, but it looks like she was also dead in weapons. Alice definitely needs to explain coming out of medbay right before I found Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1783617547.889647, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "My route was oxygen -> upper_engine -> lower_engine -> storage -> back to lower_engine. I never went to medbay or weapons, and I didn\u2019t see either body.\n\nI saw Eve in upper_engine around ticks 3-4, and then I saw Eve again in lower_engine around tick 14. I didn\u2019t see Alice at all this round, and I didn\u2019t see Frank either from my side.\n\nBased on Frank\u2019s report, Alice coming out of medbay right before Bob was found there is the biggest thing that needs explaining. Eve was in lower_engine at tick 14 from what I saw, so if Bob was killed right before the report, that makes Eve less likely for Bob specifically. But we still need Alice\u2019s route and also any info on Diana in weapons."}}
{"timestamp": 1783617560.661439, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "My route was upper_engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 back through upper_engine \u2192 lower_engine. I saw Charlie in upper_engine early, ticks 2-4, and I saw Frank leave upper_engine toward oxygen at tick 9, which matches Frank\u2019s route.\n\nI did not see Alice at all this round, and I never went to medbay or weapons, so I didn\u2019t see Bob or Diana. Around tick 14 I was in lower_engine and saw Charlie around the lower_engine/storage side, so that lines up with Charlie not being near medbay at the moment Frank found Bob.\n\nFor me, Frank\u2019s info is the strongest: Alice came out of medbay right before Bob\u2019s body was found there. Alice needs to explain that really clearly. Unless she has a solid reason or saw someone else, I\u2019m leaning Alice here."}}
{"timestamp": 1783617579.513349, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I get why that looks bad, but I did not kill Bob. My route was electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 weapons \u2192 security \u2192 electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 upper_engine \u2192 oxygen.\n\nI saw Diana alive in weapons around tick 6. Later I saw Bob in medbay around tick 11, and he was alive when I passed through. I left medbay up toward upper_engine, and Frank was the one going into medbay right after that \u2014 I literally have Frank entering medbay at tick 14. Then he reports immediately and says the body was there.\n\nSo from my side, this is not \u201cAlice came out and body was found\u201d as a clear kill. It\u2019s \u201cAlice passed through, Bob was alive earlier, Frank went in right after and reported.\u201d A self-report is very possible here. I don\u2019t have info on who killed Diana after I left weapons, but for Bob, Frank is not clear just because he reported."}}
{"timestamp": 1783617597.9075, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Alice, you\u2019re the only person so far who has placed yourself at both dead-body locations: you say you saw Diana alive in weapons, and you also say you were in medbay with Bob alive later.\n\nFrom my side, I saw you enter upper_engine from medbay at tick 14, and I went into medbay right after and found Bob dead. I reported immediately. I didn\u2019t see anyone else near medbay then.\n\nCharlie and Eve are also backing each other up around upper/lower engine at that time, and neither of them were near medbay or weapons. So unless there\u2019s some missing movement, you had the clearest opportunity for Bob, and possibly Diana too. I\u2019m still strongly leaning Alice."}}
