{"timestamp": 1783617619.356066, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I\u2019m still leaning Alice.\n\nMy own route and sightings stay the same: upper_engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 upper_engine \u2192 lower_engine. I saw Charlie early in upper_engine, and I saw Frank leave upper_engine toward oxygen at tick 9. At tick 14 I was down in lower_engine area, with Charlie around the lower_engine/storage side, so I don\u2019t think Charlie was near medbay for Bob.\n\nThe key point for me is that Alice\u2019s own route puts her at both weapons and medbay, the two body locations. Frank self-reporting Bob is possible in theory, but then Diana in weapons is still unexplained, and Alice is the only one who has admitted being near Diana alive and Bob alive before they died.\n\nSo unless Frank somehow killed both with a route nobody saw, Alice has the strongest opportunity for both kills. I\u2019m voting Alice."}}
